or cosine:\n\n$$\n1-2{sin}^{2}⁡x=\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x={75}^{∘}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1-2{sin}^{2}⁡({75}^{∘}) & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\cdot {75}^{∘}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡{150}^{∘} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-120369/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2902b205-4508-55c6-9a68-f57d3afc9eab"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-120369"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-332139/field-1/ac9362c9c743a0d4cd03c825418c9d77629147a5815c12295606faadbe8a8744" :answer/id #uuid "6cea964b-7c43-5282-bd68-8059398cb620" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-332139/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "8efdf1f1-b048-56ed-9750-68262ca3705d" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-332139/field-1/ac9362c9c743a0d4cd03c825418c9d77629147a5815c12295606faadbe8a8744" :answer-field/choices ["q-332139/field-1/ac9362c9c743a0d4cd03c825418c9d77629147a5815c12295606faadbe8a8744"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-332139" :question/id #uuid "f31d3f05-5ba5-5c12-9d43-e5237cc11367" :question/math-academy-id "q-332139" :question/problem "Find the **exact** value of the expression below.\n\n${cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{5\\pi }{12})-{sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{5\\pi }{12})=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n{cos}^{2}⁡x-{sin}^{2}⁡x=\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x=\\frac{5\\pi }{12}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{5\\pi }{12})-{sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{5\\pi }{12}) & =cos\\,(2\\cdot \\frac{5\\pi }{12}) \\\\  & =cos\\,(\\frac{5\\pi }{6}) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-332139/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2902b205-4508-55c6-9a68-f57d3afc9eab"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-332139"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-332151/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "92e97f9f-d3a8-5820-9737-fe74cda49173" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-332151/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "35cad5cc-3e40-55af-9fbd-56ee1889a1c5" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-332151/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer-field/choices ["q-332151/field-1/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-332151" :question/id #uuid "224973b3-4d0f-5f60-b8d7-c480ae784416" :question/math-academy-id "q-332151" :question/problem "Find the **exact** value of the expression below.\n\n${cos}^{4}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4})-2{cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4}){sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4})+{sin}^{4}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4})=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that our expression is a perfect square that can be rewritten as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{4}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4})-2{cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4}){sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4})+{sin}^{4}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4}) & ={({cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4})-{sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4}))}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, let's recall the double-angle formula for cosine:\n\n$$\n{cos}^{2}⁡x-{sin}^{2}⁡x=\\operatorname{cos}⁡2x\n$$\n\nSubstituting $x=\\frac{\\pi }{4}$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4})-{sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4}) & =cos\\,(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{4}) \\\\  & =cos\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{2}) \\\\  & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{({cos}^{2}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4})-{sin}^{2}\\,(\\frac{\\pi }{4}))}^{2} & ={0}^{2}=0.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-332151/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2902b205-4508-55c6-9a68-f57d3afc9eab"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-332151"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
